rence system. -> Step 6: MappingAgent -> Create the county-level choropleth map from the reprojected contiguous U.S. county dataset by symbolizing 2021 population with 5 quantile classes, using the joined population attribute and preserving the Lambert Conformal Conic projection.", "steps_completed": 6, "replans": 0, "coordinator_llm_calls": 13}, "output_json_path": "/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Coordinations/create_a_county_level_choropleth_map_showing_the_2_217.json"};
