daries. Use an official source such as the U.S. Census Bureau, and ensure the table includes a stable county identifier that matches the preserved county identifiers in the boundary dataset plus one numeric 2021 population field. Do not use any dataset that is supposed to contain county geometries; a non-spatial table is preferred.</p>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-xs font-mono bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 px-6 py-2 rounded-3xl\">\n        <span class=\"font-semibold\">TASK ID</span>\n        <span class=\"font-semibold tracking-widest\">tsk-1f48f3f7-5ed2-4cc9-a53e-984026322078</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\">\n      <div class=\"text-emerald-600 text-xs tracking-widest font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n      <div class=\"text-6xl font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">6.61s</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Specifications -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-indigo-500\">📋</span> Agent Specifications\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">AGENT NAME</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">DataRetrieverAgent</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">VERSION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">1.0.0</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">MODEL</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">gpt-4o</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-emerald-600\">6.61s</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n    <!-- Inputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-amber-500\">📥</span> Inputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Text Instruction</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Retrieve a tabular dataset of 2021 resident population by U.S. county/county-equivalent for all states and DC, suitable for joining to the existing contiguous U.S. county boundaries. Use an official source such as the U.S. Census Bureau, and ensure the table includes a stable county identifier that matches the preserved county identifiers in the boundary dataset plus one numeric 2021 population field. Do not use any dataset that is supposed to contain county geometries; a non-spatial table is preferred.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Outputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-500\">📤</span> Outputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Summary</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Data was successfully downloaded from US Census Bureau demography and saved to '/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv'.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\">/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Metrics -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-purple-500\">📊</span> Metrics\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">LLM Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">2</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Tool Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">0</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Artifacts</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">1</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- NEW: Token Usage -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-violet-500\">🔢</span> Token Usage\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">INPUT TOKENS</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-violet-600 mt-2\">3539</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">OUTPUT TOKENS</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-violet-600 mt-2\">482</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Environment -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-cyan-500\">🧪</span> Environment\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-8\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Python Version</div>\n        <div class=\"font-mono text-xl text-slate-900 mt-2\">3.12.13</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mb-3\">Domain Libraries</div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">geopandas</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">tomli</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">openai</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">python-dotenv</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">rasterio</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Beautifully syntax-highlighted Python script -->\n  \n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n            <span class=\"text-orange-500\">📜</span> Generated Python Script\n          </h3>\n          <pre class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-3xl overflow-auto max-h-[520px] shadow-inner\"><code class=\"language-python\">import requests\nimport csv\nimport json\n\ndef download_data():\n    # Define the endpoint and related configurations\n    base_url = \"https://api.census.gov/data/2021/acs/acs5\"\n    api_key = \"918876e93cf30566c02b367fcad29644d861817e\"\n    dataset_year = \"2021\"\n    dataset_source = f\"ACS {dataset_year}\"\n\n    # Variables we need to fetch\n    variables = [\n        # B01001_001E: Total population\n        \"B01001_001E\",\n    ]\n\n    # Fetch the variable labels\n    response = requests.get(f\"{base_url}/variables.json\")\n    variables_metadata = response.json()\n\n    # Helper function to get variable labels\n    def get_variable_label(var_name):\n        label = variables_metadata['variables'][var_name]['label']\n        return label.replace(\"Estimate!!\", \"\").strip()\n\n    # Construct the URL for the data request\n    get_vars = \",\".join(variables)\n    url = f\"{base_url}?get={get_vars}&for=county:*&key={api_key}\"\n\n    # Download data from Census API\n    response = requests.get(url)\n    response.raise_for_status()\n    data = response.json()\n\n    # Prepare the CSV file for writing\n    csv_path = \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\"\n\n    # Create header with variable labels\n    header = [f\"{var}:{get_variable_label(var)}\" for var in variables] + [\"state_fips\", \"county_fips\", \"year\", \"source\"]\n    rows = data[1:]  # Skip the header row provided by API\n    for row in rows:\n        row.extend([dataset_year, dataset_source])\n\n    # Write to CSV file\n    with open(csv_path, mode='w', newline='') as file:\n        writer = csv.writer(file)\n        writer.writerow(header)\n        writer.writerows(rows)\n\n# Execute the function\ndownload_data()</code></pre>\n        </div>\n        \n\n  <!-- Additional rich data -->\n  <div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"uppercase text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\">🔬</span> Provenance &amp; Artifacts</h3>\n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Execution</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Inputs\": {\n    \"text\": \"Retrieve a tabular dataset of 2021 resident population by U.S. county/county-equivalent for all states and DC, suitable for joining to the existing contiguous U.S. county boundaries. Use an official source such as the U.S. Census Bureau, and ensure the table includes a stable county identifier that matches the preserved county identifiers in the boundary dataset plus one numeric 2021 population field. Do not use any dataset that is supposed to contain county geometries; a non-spatial table is preferred.\",\n    \"dataset_path\": null\n  },\n  \"Outputs\": {\n    \"text\": \"Data was successfully downloaded from US Census Bureau demography and saved to '/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv'.\",\n    \"dataset_path\": \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\",\n    \"dataset_size\": {\n      \"type\": null,\n      \"dimensions\": null,\n      \"feature_count\": null\n    }\n  }\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            \n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Provenance</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Lineage\": {\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Source selection via LLM\",\n      \"Handbook loading\",\n      \"Download code generation\",\n      \"Code execution and debugging\",\n      \"Output normalization (GeoJSON conversion for vector data, if applicable)\"\n    ],\n    \"note\": \"Detailed steps not captured individually; see code for full process.\"\n  },\n  \"Tool Calls\": {},\n  \"LLM Calls\": 2\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            \n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Artifacts and Logs</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Inline Artifacts\": {\n    \"generated_script\": \"import requests\\nimport csv\\nimport json\\n\\ndef download_data():\\n    # Define the endpoint and related configurations\\n    base_url = \\\"https://api.census.gov/data/2021/acs/acs5\\\"\\n    api_key = \\\"918876e93cf30566c02b367fcad29644d861817e\\\"\\n    dataset_year = \\\"2021\\\"\\n    dataset_source = f\\\"ACS {dataset_year}\\\"\\n\\n    # Variables we need to fetch\\n    variables = [\\n        # B01001_001E: Total population\\n        \\\"B01001_001E\\\",\\n    ]\\n\\n    # Fetch the variable labels\\n    response = requests.get(f\\\"{base_url}/variables.json\\\")\\n    variables_metadata = response.json()\\n\\n    # Helper function to get variable labels\\n    def get_variable_label(var_name):\\n        label = variables_metadata['variables'][var_name]['label']\\n        return label.replace(\\\"Estimate!!\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n\\n    # Construct the URL for the data request\\n    get_vars = \\\",\\\".join(variables)\\n    url = f\\\"{base_url}?get={get_vars}&for=county:*&key={api_key}\\\"\\n\\n    # Download data from Census API\\n    response = requests.get(url)\\n    response.raise_for_status()\\n    data = response.json()\\n\\n    # Prepare the CSV file for writing\\n    csv_path = \\\"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\\\"\\n\\n    # Create header with variable labels\\n    header = [f\\\"{var}:{get_variable_label(var)}\\\" for var in variables] + [\\\"state_fips\\\", \\\"county_fips\\\", \\\"year\\\", \\\"source\\\"]\\n    rows = data[1:]  # Skip the header row provided by API\\n    for row in rows:\\n        row.extend([dataset_year, dataset_source])\\n\\n    # Write to CSV file\\n    with open(csv_path, mode='w', newline='') as file:\\n        writer = csv.writer(file)\\n        writer.writerow(header)\\n        writer.writerows(rows)\\n\\n# Execute the function\\ndownload_data()\"\n  },\n  \"Persisted Artifacts\": [\n    \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\"\n  ]\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            </div>\n\n</div>\n", "3": "\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10\">\n\n  <!-- Agent Header -->\n  <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-3xl\">\n        STEP 4\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-3\">VectorAnalysisAgent</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-md\">Join the 2021 county population table to the contiguous U.S. county boundary layer by constructing the standard 5-digit county identifier from the state and county codes in the table and matching it to the preserved county identifier in the boundaries. Keep only records for the contiguous United States, verify the join coverage is complete or note any unmatched counties, and ensure the joined population attribute is stored as numeric for later quantile classification.</p>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-xs font-mono bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 px-6 py-2 rounded-3xl\">\n        <span class=\"font-semibold\">TASK ID</span>\n        <span class=\"font-semibold tracking-widest\">tsk-8ed66bc2-aec8-4260-9b95-5ea86759b7d2</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\">\n      <div class=\"text-emerald-600 text-xs tracking-widest font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n      <div class=\"text-6xl font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">33.69s</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Specifications -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-indigo-500\">📋</span> Agent Specifications\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">AGENT NAME</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">VectorAnalysisAgent</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">VERSION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">2.1.0</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">MODEL</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">gpt-5.4</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-emerald-600\">33.69s</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n    <!-- Inputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-amber-500\">📥</span> Inputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Text Instruction</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Join the 2021 county population table to the contiguous U.S. county boundary layer by constructing the standard 5-digit county identifier from the state and county codes in the table and matching it to the preserved county identifier in the boundaries. Keep only records for the contiguous United States, verify the join coverage is complete or note any unmatched counties, and ensure the joined population attribute is stored as numeric for later quantile classification.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\">['Data/contiguous_counties_863529_701650.geojson', '/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv']</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Outputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-500\">📤</span> Outputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Summary</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Done.\n\nSummary:\n- Loaded the contiguous county boundary GeoJSON and 2021 population CSV.\n- Constructed the standard 5-digit county GEOID in the table as:\n  - 2-digit `state_fips`\n  - 3-digit `county_fips`\n  - concatenated to `GEOID`\n- Performed a non-spatial join to the boundary layer on `GEOID`.\n- Kept geometry in the output.\n- Stored population as numeric in `population_2021`.\n\nJoin verification:\n- Boundary counties: 3108\n- Matched counties: 3108\n- Unmatched boundary counties: 0\n\nNotes:\n- The population table contains 113 GEOIDs not present in the contiguous boundary layer. These are expected to be outside the contiguous U.S. set or otherwise excluded from that boundary file.\n\nOutputs:\n- Final GeoDataFrame registered as: `contiguous_counties_population_2021_joined`\n- GeoJSON written to:\n  `/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/contiguous_counties_population_2021_joined.geojson`\n\nKey output field:\n- `population_2021` → numeric (`int64`) and ready for quantile classification later.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\">Data/county_join_759877_276576.geojson</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Metrics -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-purple-500\">📊</span> Metrics\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">LLM Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">4</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Tool Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">2</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Artifacts</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">1</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- NEW: Token Usage -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-violet-500\">🔢</span> Token Usage\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">INPUT TOKENS</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-violet-600 mt-2\">13292</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">OUTPUT TOKENS</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-violet-600 mt-2\">0</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Environment -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-cyan-500\">🧪</span> Environment\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-8\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Python Version</div>\n        <div class=\"font-mono text-xl text-slate-900 mt-2\">3.12.13</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mb-3\">Domain Libraries</div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">geopandas</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">pandas</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">numpy</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-3xl\">shapely</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Beautifully syntax-highlighted Python script -->\n  \n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n            <span class=\"text-orange-500\">📜</span> Generated Python Script\n          </h3>\n          <pre class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-3xl overflow-auto max-h-[520px] shadow-inner\"><code class=\"language-python\">import pandas as pd\nimport geopandas as gpd\n\n# File paths\ncounties_path = \"Data/contiguous_counties_863529_701650.geojson\"\npopulation_path = \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\"\nout_path = \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/contiguous_counties_population_2021_joined.geojson\"\n\n# Load data once\ncounties = gpd.read_file(counties_path)\npop = pd.read_csv(population_path)\n\n# Keep only 2021 records if a year column exists\nif \"year\" in pop.columns:\n    pop = pop.loc[pop[\"year\"] == 2021].copy()\n\n# Construct standard 5-digit county GEOID from state and county codes\npop[\"GEOID\"] = (\n    pd.to_numeric(pop[\"state_fips\"], errors=\"coerce\").astype(\"Int64\").astype(str).str.zfill(2)\n    + pd.to_numeric(pop[\"county_fips\"], errors=\"coerce\").astype(\"Int64\").astype(str).str.zfill(3)\n)\n\n# Ensure population is numeric for later quantile classification\npop[\"population_2021\"] = pd.to_numeric(pop[\"B01001_001E:Total:\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n\n# Check for duplicate GEOIDs in the population table\ndup_count = int(pop[\"GEOID\"].duplicated().sum())\nprint(\"Duplicate GEOIDs in population table:\", dup_count)\nif dup_count:\n    dup_cols = [c for c in [\"GEOID\", \"state_fips\", \"county_fips\", \"year\"] if c in pop.columns]\n    print(pop.loc[pop[\"GEOID\"].duplicated(keep=False), dup_cols].sort_values(\"GEOID\").head(20))\n\n# Join population to contiguous county boundaries\njoin_cols = [c for c in [\"GEOID\", \"population_2021\", \"B01001_001E:Total:\", \"state_fips\", \"county_fips\", \"year\", \"source\"] if c in pop.columns]\nresult = counties.merge(pop[join_cols], on=\"GEOID\", how=\"left\", validate=\"1:1\")\n\n# Verify join coverage\nmatched = int(result[\"population_2021\"].notna().sum())\nunmatched = int(result[\"population_2021\"].isna().sum())\nprint(\"Boundary counties:\", len(result))\nprint(\"Matched counties:\", matched)\nprint(\"Unmatched counties:\", unmatched)\n\nif unmatched:\n    unmatched_cols = [c for c in [\"GEOID\", \"STATEFP\", \"COUNTYFP\", \"NAME\", \"STUSPS\", \"STATE_NAME\"] if c in result.columns]\n    unmatched_df = result.loc[result[\"population_2021\"].isna(), unmatched_cols].copy()\n    print(\"Unmatched county examples:\")\n    print(unmatched_df.head(20))\nelse:\n    print(\"Join coverage is complete for contiguous counties.\")\n\n# Check for population-table counties not present in the contiguous boundary layer\nextra_tabular = sorted(set(pop[\"GEOID\"]) - set(counties[\"GEOID\"]))\nprint(\"Population table GEOIDs not in contiguous boundary layer:\", len(extra_tabular))\nif extra_tabular:\n    extra_cols = [c for c in [\"GEOID\", \"state_fips\", \"county_fips\", \"population_2021\", \"year\", \"source\"] if c in pop.columns]\n    print(pop.loc[pop[\"GEOID\"].isin(extra_tabular), extra_cols].head(20))\n\n# Confirm numeric dtype\nprint(result[[\"GEOID\", \"population_2021\"]].dtypes)\n\n# Write output\nresult.to_file(out_path, driver=\"GeoJSON\")\nprint(\"Wrote GeoJSON to:\", out_path)</code></pre>\n        </div>\n        \n\n  <!-- Additional rich data -->\n  <div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"uppercase text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\">🔬</span> Provenance &amp; Artifacts</h3>\n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Execution</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Inputs\": {\n    \"text\": \"Join the 2021 county population table to the contiguous U.S. county boundary layer by constructing the standard 5-digit county identifier from the state and county codes in the table and matching it to the preserved county identifier in the boundaries. Keep only records for the contiguous United States, verify the join coverage is complete or note any unmatched counties, and ensure the joined population attribute is stored as numeric for later quantile classification.\",\n    \"dataset_path\": [\n      \"Data/contiguous_counties_863529_701650.geojson\",\n      \"/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Data/tabular_2021_418675.csv\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"Outputs\": {\n    \"dataset_path\": \"Data/county_join_759877_276576.geojson\",\n    \"dataset_size\": {\n      \"type\": \"vector\",\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        3108,\n        19\n      ],\n      \"feature_count\": 3108\n    }\n  }\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            \n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Provenance</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Lineage\": {},\n  \"Tool Calls\": {\n    \"execute_script_count\": 2,\n    \"search_knowledge_base_count\": 0,\n    \"register_final_artifact_count\": 1\n  },\n  \"LLM Calls\": {\n    \"total\": 4\n  }\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            \n            <details class=\"group mb-6\">\n                <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-5 rounded-3xl text-slate-700 font-semibold\">\n                    <span>Artifacts and Logs</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\">↓</span>\n                </summary>\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 px-6 py-6 rounded-b-3xl border border-t-0 border-slate-200\">\n                    <pre class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 overflow-auto max-h-80 p-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">{\n  \"Inline Artifacts\": {},\n  \"Persisted Artifacts\": {\n    \"final_artifact_key\": \"contiguous_counties_population_2021_joined\",\n    \"path\": \"Data/county_join_759877_276576.geojson\",\n    \"type\": \"GeoDataFrame\",\n    \"rows\": 3108\n  }\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n            </div>\n\n</div>\n", "4": "\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10\">\n\n  <!-- Agent Header -->\n  <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-3xl\">\n        STEP 5\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-3\">MapProjectionAgent</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-md\">Reproject the joined county dataset to a Lambert Conformal Conic coordinate reference system.</p>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-xs font-mono bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 px-6 py-2 rounded-3xl\">\n        <span class=\"font-semibold\">TASK ID</span>\n        <span class=\"font-semibold tracking-widest\">tsk-a38b2fa3-a142-489a-bdfd-0d69f853d278</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\">\n      <div class=\"text-emerald-600 text-xs tracking-widest font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n      <div class=\"text-6xl font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">7.97s</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Specifications -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-indigo-500\">📋</span> Agent Specifications\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">AGENT NAME</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">MapProjectionAgent</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">VERSION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">2.0.0</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">MODEL</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-slate-900\">gpt-4o</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">DURATION</div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg mt-1 text-emerald-600\">7.97s</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n    <!-- Inputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-amber-500\">📥</span> Inputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Text Instruction</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Reproject the joined county dataset to a Lambert Conformal Conic coordinate reference system.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\">Data/county_join_759877_276576.geojson</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Outputs -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-500\">📤</span> Outputs\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Summary</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">The county dataset has been successfully reprojected to the 'USA Contiguous Lambert Conformal Conic' coordinate reference system (ESRI:102004). This CRS is specifically tailored for the contiguous United States, ensuring accurate area and distance measurements, which is ideal for regional analysis at the county level. The Lambert Conformal Conic projection minimizes distortion for east-west oriented areas, making it a perfect fit for your dataset.\n\nTechnical Report:\nThe 'USA Contiguous Lambert Conformal Conic' (ESRI:102004) is selected as the most appropriate CRS for the task of reprojecting a county dataset within the United States. This CRS is specifically designed for the contiguous United States (CONUS) and is ideal for regional analysis, preserving area and shape across large extents. The Lambert Conformal Conic projection is well-suited for mid-latitude countries like the USA, providing minimal distortion for east-west extents, which is typical for county-level datasets. This choice ensures accurate representation and measurement of distances and areas within the dataset, making it superior to global CRSs for this specific regional application.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs uppercase font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2\">Dataset Path</div>\n          <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm break-all\">/home/abk6234/GAS/mysite2/Output/Reproject_the_joined_county_dataset_to_a_034967.geojson</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Metrics -->\n  <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700\">\n      <span class=\"text-purple-500\">📊</span> Metrics\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">LLM Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">3</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Tool Calls</div>\n        <div class=\"text-5xl font-mono font-semibold text-purple-600 mt-2\">2</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-sl